  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2463630,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that some of us just start\nto accept as unsolvable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2467200,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For me, shaving was one of these things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2469480,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The irritation, the razor burn,"
