  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2473980,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It felt like something I just\nkinda had to put up with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2477430,
    "dDurationMs": 996,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then I started using"
